# This directory contains voice reference files for ReelForge TTS synthesis
# 
# Place your voice reference files here following the naming convention:
#   voice_ref_[speaker_name].wav
#
# Examples:
#   voice_ref_cilian_murphy.wav
#   voice_ref_morgan_freeman.wav
#   voice_ref_deep_calm.wav
#
# For detailed instructions, see README.md
